<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wake up.</font>

34
00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:50,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come here.</font>

35
00:01:51,790 --> 00:01:54,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The result for Jiang Shengli's matter has been decided.</font>

36
00:01:58,950 --> 00:01:59,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The injury</font>

37
00:01:59,590 --> 00:02:00,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is categorized as a Grade II Minor Injury.</font>

38
00:02:00,710 --> 00:02:03,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Shengli refuses mediation and compensation.</font>

39
00:02:03,230 --> 00:02:04,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Coroner Li says</font>

40
00:02:04,790 --> 00:02:05,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he will face a long sentence.</font>

41
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:08,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not bad.</font>

42
00:02:08,150 --> 00:02:10,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That counts as good karma.</font>

43
00:02:11,190 --> 00:02:12,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But can the jerk say</font>

44
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:14,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that his wife passed away</font>

45
00:02:14,430 --> 00:02:15,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so he was too upset</font>

46
00:02:15,430 --> 00:02:16,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and he raised the defense of insanity</font>

47
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:17,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to regain his freedom?</font>

48
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:19,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The police are smarter than you.</font>

49
00:02:19,080 --> 00:02:20,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They won't let him go so easily.</font>

50
00:02:20,710 --> 00:02:21,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't make assumptions.</font>

51
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:23,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One more thing.</font>

52
00:02:25,430 --> 00:02:28,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Shengli knew the jerk's wife</font>

53
00:02:28,030 --> 00:02:29,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from a long time ago.</font>

54
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:34,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Moreover, his wife is quite close to Jiang Shengli.</font>

55
00:02:45,990 --> 00:02:47,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That makes sense.</font>

56
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:49,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is instant karma.</font>

57
00:02:51,750 --> 00:02:53,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Shengli is quite responsible.</font>

58
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:54,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He insisted</font>

59
00:02:54,710 --> 00:02:56,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that he orchestrated the whole thing.</font>

60
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:58,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It had nothing to do with us at all.</font>

61
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:05,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Although</font>

62
00:03:05,590 --> 00:03:07,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we have nothing to do with the police anymore,</font>

63
00:03:07,150 --> 00:03:08,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our superiors</font>

64
00:03:08,430 --> 00:03:10,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">want us to give them an explanation.</font>

65
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:12,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone must submit a letter of apology.</font>

66
00:03:13,190 --> 00:03:13,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come back!</font>

67
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:14,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not writing one.</font>

68
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:16,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our superiors said this.</font>

69
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:17,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A certain colleague.</font>

70
00:03:18,250 --> 00:03:20,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A certain colleague called Chen</font>

71
00:03:20,430 --> 00:03:22,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">must not do any creative writing</font>

72
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:23,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">while writing the letter of apology.</font>

73
00:03:24,360 --> 00:03:26,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What you write is going to be filed,</font>

74
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:28,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">not published into a book, Missy.</font>

75
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:29,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If the reports I've written all these years</font>

76
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:30,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can be published into a book,</font>

77
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:31,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there might really be readers.</font>

78
00:03:31,940 --> 00:03:32,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

79
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:35,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If a film company purchases the rights to it,</font>

80
00:03:35,150 --> 00:03:36,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll have a drama to binge watch.</font>

81
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:38,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dream on. Who would watch something like this?</font>

82
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:41,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are they going to watch us restore the deceased?</font>

83
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:42,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everything will be censored.</font>

84
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:44,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides, who would want to act in it?</font>

85
00:03:44,430 --> 00:03:45,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How will they actually handle it on set?</font>

86
00:03:45,870 --> 00:03:47,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your roles are not exactly movie material either.</font>

87
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:49,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao Erzhe, how many lines do you have?</font>

88
00:03:49,150 --> 00:03:50,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chen Hexu, you have a gloomy face all the time.</font>

89
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:51,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Song Tianshuang.</font>

90
00:03:51,590 --> 00:03:52,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know who's going to play your role.</font>

91
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:53,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's nothing special about you.</font>

92
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:54,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You too, Wang Can.</font>

93
00:03:54,750 --> 00:03:56,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You talk a lot</font>

94
00:03:56,470 --> 00:03:57,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">without stopping.</font>

95
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:59,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This place was quiet before you came.</font>

96
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:00,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides,</font>

97
00:04:00,710 --> 00:04:02,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">which senseless director would direct something like this?</font>

98
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:04,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So,</font>

99
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:06,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you must write the letter of apology.</font>

100
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:06,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">However,</font>

101
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:08,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've written them for all of you.</font>

102
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:11,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You just need to sign it.</font>

103
00:04:12,310 --> 00:04:12,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

104
00:04:13,750 --> 00:04:14,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gosh.</font>

105
00:04:14,870 --> 00:04:15,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Given your kind gesture,</font>

106
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:16,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if they are making this into a drama,</font>

107
00:04:16,510 --> 00:04:17,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'll definitely be the male lead.</font>

108
00:04:18,070 --> 00:04:18,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's a given.</font>

109
00:04:19,510 --> 00:04:21,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm a superior-level worker. What level are you?</font>

110
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:24,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you think you deserve to be the male lead?</font>

111
00:04:25,190 --> 00:04:25,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move.</font>

112
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:29,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Dandan. - Are you having a tea meeting?</font>

113
00:04:30,510 --> 00:04:31,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you all free today?</font>

114
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:33,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's no work, Dandan.</font>

115
00:04:33,750 --> 00:04:34,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No work?</font>

116
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:35,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

117
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Mortuary Care Department has talked to the superiors.</font>

118
00:04:38,070 --> 00:04:40,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In order to improve their employees' skills,</font>

119
00:04:40,390 --> 00:04:41,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they've used an extremely low price</font>

120
00:04:41,270 --> 00:04:42,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to send many deceased over.</font>

121
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:43,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you mean?</font>

122
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:45,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are they practicing with the deceased?</font>

123
00:04:45,750 --> 00:04:46,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

124
00:04:47,310 --> 00:04:48,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They can't do something too complicated,</font>

125
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:49,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but giving the deceased</font>

126
00:04:50,190 --> 00:04:50,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a bath</font>

127
00:04:50,750 --> 00:04:51,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or helping with makeup</font>

128
00:04:51,630 --> 00:04:52,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is no problem for those kids.</font>

129
00:04:53,310 --> 00:04:54,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The kids will be fine.</font>

130
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:56,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The problem lies with Du.</font>

131
00:04:57,310 --> 00:04:58,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director Du from the Mortuary Care Department</font>

132
00:04:58,750 --> 00:04:59,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is evil.</font>

133
00:04:59,950 --> 00:05:01,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He is always scheming.</font>

134
00:05:01,800 --> 00:05:02,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

135
00:05:02,630 --> 00:05:03,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I was having breakfast this morning,</font>

136
00:05:03,750 --> 00:05:05,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he came to me in the canteen sneakily.</font>

137
00:05:05,310 --> 00:05:05,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He asked me</font>

138
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:07,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if I could head over and help out if I was free.</font>

139
00:05:07,510 --> 00:05:08,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He asked me too.</font>

140
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:09,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Me too.</font>

141
00:05:10,870 --> 00:05:12,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director Du is not bad.</font>

142
00:05:12,190 --> 00:05:12,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He didn't ask me.</font>

143
00:05:19,430 --> 00:05:20,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is he looking down on my skills?</font>

144
00:05:21,430 --> 00:05:23,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can, be confident.</font>

145
00:05:23,510 --> 00:05:24,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He is looking down on you.</font>

146
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:27,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right. I have no skills.</font>

147
00:05:29,190 --> 00:05:30,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In my opinion,</font>

148
00:05:30,070 --> 00:05:31,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just tell Du</font>

149
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:32,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that he doesn't need to</font>

150
00:05:32,310 --> 00:05:34,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">ask my employees in secret next time.</font>

151
00:05:34,310 --> 00:05:35,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just go to the superiors</font>

152
00:05:35,950 --> 00:05:38,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and tell them to shut down the mortuary prep team</font>

153
00:05:38,190 --> 00:05:39,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and keep the Mortuary Care Department.</font>

154
00:05:40,070 --> 00:05:40,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh no, sir.</font>

155
00:05:40,950 --> 00:05:42,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director Du will be the male lead now.</font>

156
00:05:45,890 --> 00:05:48,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao Erzhe! Have you been practicing your triple-cavity infusion?</font>

157
00:05:48,190 --> 00:05:49,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're just playing games and swiping your phone.</font>

158
00:05:49,160 --> 00:05:50,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go and practice!</font>

159
00:05:50,310 --> 00:05:51,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chen Hexu, why are you laughing?</font>

160
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:53,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your facial shaping is worse than Wang Can's.</font>

161
00:05:53,750 --> 00:05:54,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can't you practice more?</font>

162
00:05:54,630 --> 00:05:56,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why am I involved, sir?</font>

163
00:05:56,070 --> 00:05:57,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're always slacking!</font>

164
00:05:58,000 --> 00:05:58,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't study well.</font>

165
00:05:58,950 --> 00:06:00,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What level are you now? Shouldn't you be revising?</font>

166
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:02,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You too! Song Tianshuang!</font>

167
00:06:02,830 --> 00:06:03,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cao Yongji.</font>

168
00:06:04,430 --> 00:06:05,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you mad?</font>

169
00:06:05,430 --> 00:06:06,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you shouting at my employees?</font>

170
00:06:08,070 --> 00:06:08,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Song Tianshuang.</font>

171
00:06:09,270 --> 00:06:10,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's the name of the male idol you like?</font>

172
00:06:11,510 --> 00:06:13,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One of his relatives passed away.</font>

173
00:06:13,430 --> 00:06:14,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He is getting the paperwork done upstairs.</font>

174
00:06:14,390 --> 00:06:15,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He has to come down and sign the documents later.</font>

175
00:06:15,510 --> 00:06:16,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go and wait for him in the registration room.</font>

176
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:18,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait. Come back.</font>

177
00:06:20,270 --> 00:06:21,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hide your smile.</font>

178
00:06:21,830 --> 00:06:22,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

179
00:06:25,310 --> 00:06:26,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Act solemnly!</font>

180
00:06:31,310 --> 00:06:32,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan is already back. Are you still not going to work?</font>

181
00:06:35,310 --> 00:06:36,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hold on. Who signed my name on it?</font>

182
00:06:36,680 --> 00:06:37,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not the one apologizing.</font>

183
00:06:54,070 --> 00:06:56,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello. I'm Song Tianshuang.</font>

184
00:06:56,430 --> 00:06:57,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's my honor to serve you.</font>

185
00:07:00,830 --> 00:07:01,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sorry for your loss.</font>

186
00:07:06,830 --> 00:07:08,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please show me your ID.</font>

187
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:10,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to register your information.</font>

188
00:07:26,070 --> 00:07:27,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These are the documents</font>

189
00:07:27,160 --> 00:07:28,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">family members need to sign for the refrigeration unit.</font>

190
00:07:28,630 --> 00:07:29,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take a look.</font>

191
00:07:30,390 --> 00:07:33,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This signature can only be used for this specific purpose.</font>

192
00:07:33,190 --> 00:07:34,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't take pictures of it and share them elsewhere.</font>

193
00:07:35,950 --> 00:07:36,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Madam,</font>

194
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:37,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we</font>

195
00:07:37,950 --> 00:07:39,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have strict policies and procedures.</font>

196
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:41,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Information about the deceased and his family members must never be revealed.</font>

197
00:07:47,720 --> 00:07:48,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Excuse me.</font>

198
00:07:49,160 --> 00:07:50,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please confirm your relationship</font>

199
00:07:50,510 --> 00:07:52,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with the deceased.</font>

200
00:07:54,270 --> 00:07:55,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She is my aunt.</font>

201
00:07:56,390 --> 00:07:58,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The refrigeration process requires a direct relative's</font>

202
00:07:58,190 --> 00:07:59,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">confirmation and signature.</font>

203
00:07:59,510 --> 00:08:01,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please get the deceased's parents, children,</font>

204
00:08:01,750 --> 00:08:03,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or partner to sign.</font>

205
00:08:04,070 --> 00:08:05,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her children are rushing here.</font>

206
00:08:05,870 --> 00:08:07,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My uncle is doing something upstairs.</font>

207
00:08:07,750 --> 00:08:08,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well...</font>

208
00:08:08,430 --> 00:08:09,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sorry.</font>

209
00:08:09,750 --> 00:08:11,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should ask direct relatives to come here</font>

210
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:12,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when they are free.</font>

211
00:08:13,750 --> 00:08:14,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hope you understand.</font>

212
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:18,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it. Thank you.</font>

213
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:25,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's so handsome.</font>

214
00:08:31,480 --> 00:08:32,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gosh.</font>

215
00:08:35,270 --> 00:08:37,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I forgot to get his autograph.</font>

216
00:08:45,790 --> 00:08:46,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan.</font>

217
00:08:46,790 --> 00:08:47,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This body from the car accident,</font>

218
00:08:48,030 --> 00:08:49,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">his right upper arm is completely torn from the body.</font>

219
00:08:50,510 --> 00:08:51,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right. Let's begin the disinfection process.</font>

220
00:08:52,030 --> 00:08:54,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After that, we'll let Mao do the embalming.</font>

221
00:08:54,270 --> 00:08:55,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Finally, you'll sew the parts back on.</font>

222
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:56,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

223
00:09:02,760 --> 00:09:04,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You need to disinfect even the small wounds.</font>

224
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:08,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Madam.</font>

225
00:09:11,480 --> 00:09:11,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Madam.</font>

226
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:15,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao, are you done with disinfection?</font>

227
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:15,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

228
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:17,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get ready for the embalming process.</font>

229
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:18,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't even stop a family member?</font>

230
00:09:18,510 --> 00:09:19,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could I?</font>

231
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:23,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's unsafe. She didn't go through the disinfection process.</font>

232
00:09:31,390 --> 00:09:32,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How do I stop her?</font>

233
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:37,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I couldn't stop her.</font>

234
00:09:37,480 --> 00:09:38,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She wasn't wearing any protective gear.</font>

235
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:40,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's even pregnant.</font>

236
00:09:40,750 --> 00:09:41,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhu Zhanghong.</font>

237
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:43,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get up.</font>

238
00:09:52,510 --> 00:09:54,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I went for the final prenatal check-up on my own.</font>

239
00:09:57,360 --> 00:09:58,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I told you</font>

240
00:09:59,510 --> 00:10:00,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">not to come back.</font>

241
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:05,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were busy at work.</font>

242
00:10:07,150 --> 00:10:09,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't want you to drive overnight.</font>

243
00:10:10,390 --> 00:10:11,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It wasn't safe.</font>

244
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:16,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why didn't you listen to me?</font>

245
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:24,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why didn't you listen to me?</font>

246
00:10:28,630 --> 00:10:29,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wake up.</font>

247
00:10:30,910 --> 00:10:32,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wake up.</font>

248
00:10:33,150 --> 00:10:34,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you wake up?</font>

249
00:10:35,750 --> 00:10:36,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look.</font>

250
00:10:36,580 --> 00:10:38,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Complex Remains Processing Room]</font>

251
00:10:38,910 --> 00:10:40,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is our child.</font>

252
00:10:44,150 --> 00:10:46,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He looks like this now.</font>

253
00:10:47,300 --> 00:10:48,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Color Ultrasound Report]</font>

254
00:10:48,870 --> 00:10:50,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is his head.</font>

255
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:52,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The doctor says</font>

256
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:54,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">his head is a little big.</font>

257
00:10:56,510 --> 00:10:58,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">343 millimeters.</font>

258
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:02,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This one.</font>

259
00:11:04,630 --> 00:11:05,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is the fetal heart rate.</font>

260
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:07,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It is beating</font>

261
00:11:07,750 --> 00:11:09,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">144 times per minute.</font>

262
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:14,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The doctor said the child was healthy</font>

263
00:11:16,150 --> 00:11:16,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and active.</font>

264
00:11:20,630 --> 00:11:22,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's just a little overweight.</font>

265
00:11:24,160 --> 00:11:26,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's 3.75 kilograms.</font>

266
00:11:30,750 --> 00:11:31,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you see this?</font>

267
00:11:33,630 --> 00:11:34,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at it.</font>

268
00:11:34,630 --> 00:11:35,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you see this?</font>

269
00:11:35,480 --> 00:11:36,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at it!</font>

270
00:11:36,870 --> 00:11:38,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you seeing this?</font>

271
00:11:39,790 --> 00:11:42,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll be meeting him in two weeks.</font>

272
00:11:42,360 --> 00:11:44,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why?</font>

273
00:12:03,270 --> 00:12:04,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is your arm?</font>

274
00:12:05,360 --> 00:12:06,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's your arm?</font>

275
00:12:07,750 --> 00:12:09,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dear, where's your arm?</font>

276
00:12:09,750 --> 00:12:11,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is his arm?</font>

277
00:12:11,870 --> 00:12:13,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dear, where is your arm?</font>

278
00:12:13,910 --> 00:12:15,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is my husband's arm?</font>

279
00:12:16,270 --> 00:12:17,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must be in so much pain!</font>

280
00:12:22,270 --> 00:12:23,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is your arm?</font>

281
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:29,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can you hold your child without your arm?</font>

282
00:12:31,270 --> 00:12:32,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir!</font>

283
00:12:32,630 --> 00:12:33,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry!</font>

284
00:12:33,270 --> 00:12:34,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go and get her out.</font>

285
00:12:34,390 --> 00:12:35,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's inside.</font>

286
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:37,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can you carry the child?</font>

287
00:12:37,790 --> 00:12:38,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dear!</font>

288
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:45,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want to live anymore!</font>

289
00:12:45,270 --> 00:12:46,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianshuang, hold her up.</font>

290
00:12:47,750 --> 00:12:48,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want to live anymore!</font>

291
00:12:48,870 --> 00:12:49,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come. Let's go.</font>

292
00:12:50,390 --> 00:12:51,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move.</font>

293
00:12:51,320 --> 00:12:52,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go. Let's go home.</font>

294
00:12:53,550 --> 00:12:53,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

295
00:12:54,630 --> 00:12:56,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, help them with the disinfection.</font>

296
00:13:20,320 --> 00:13:21,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Quick! Go out and help them!</font>

297
00:13:21,670 --> 00:13:22,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's bad!</font>

298
00:13:22,510 --> 00:13:23,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What happened?</font>

299
00:13:23,150 --> 00:13:23,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The pregnant lady.</font>

300
00:13:24,030 --> 00:13:25,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She has fainted.</font>

301
00:13:25,670 --> 00:13:26,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry.</font>

302
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:31,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry!</font>

303
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:38,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry!</font>

304
00:13:41,390 --> 00:13:42,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come here. Careful.</font>

305
00:13:42,910 --> 00:13:44,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it because of the emotion?</font>

306
00:13:44,750 --> 00:13:45,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you called an ambulance?</font>

307
00:13:45,390 --> 00:13:46,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have.</font>

308
00:13:46,670 --> 00:13:47,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take her to rest.</font>

309
00:13:47,670 --> 00:13:48,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her water broke.</font>

310
00:13:50,120 --> 00:13:51,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's giving birth.</font>

311
00:13:51,390 --> 00:13:53,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She can't be lying down here.</font>

312
00:13:53,270 --> 00:13:54,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can, get a cart.</font>

313
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:55,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Yes! - I'll go and get an umbrella.</font>

314
00:13:55,120 --> 00:13:55,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry!</font>

315
00:13:58,030 --> 00:13:59,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Relax. Take deep breaths.</font>

316
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:01,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen to me.</font>

317
00:14:01,080 --> 00:14:02,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Breathe in.</font>

318
00:14:02,200 --> 00:14:02,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ambulance?</font>

319
00:14:03,390 --> 00:14:04,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are you?</font>

320
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:07,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you hurry up?</font>

321
00:14:07,720 --> 00:14:08,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please, I beg you.</font>

322
00:14:08,750 --> 00:14:09,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Deep breaths.</font>

323
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:12,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be scared. Relax.</font>

324
00:14:43,440 --> 00:14:44,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is Wang Can?</font>

325
00:14:45,080 --> 00:14:46,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can, hurry!</font>

326
00:14:47,080 --> 00:14:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Coming!</font>

327
00:14:48,200 --> 00:14:49,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The cart is here.</font>

328
00:14:52,560 --> 00:14:54,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sorry.</font>

329
00:14:54,050 --> 00:14:55,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is the only cart we have.</font>

330
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:56,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hope you don't mind.</font>

331
00:14:56,670 --> 00:14:57,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not at all.</font>

332
00:14:57,600 --> 00:14:58,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As long as it's safe.</font>

333
00:14:58,670 --> 00:14:59,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

334
00:14:59,200 --> 00:15:00,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come. Don't move.</font>

335
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:01,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

336
00:15:01,390 --> 00:15:02,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Three, two, one.</font>

337
00:15:05,790 --> 00:15:07,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Careful. Slowly.</font>

338
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:07,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Careful.</font>

339
00:15:07,720 --> 00:15:09,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Look out. - Careful.</font>

340
00:15:09,150 --> 00:15:10,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cover her.</font>

341
00:15:11,080 --> 00:15:12,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone, calm down.</font>

342
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:14,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is this her first child?</font>

343
00:15:14,270 --> 00:15:15,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

344
00:15:15,390 --> 00:15:16,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After the water breaks,</font>

345
00:15:16,790 --> 00:15:18,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it can take a long time</font>

346
00:15:18,440 --> 00:15:19,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for the cervix to fully dilate.</font>

347
00:15:19,840 --> 00:15:21,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can wait for the doctor.</font>

348
00:15:21,320 --> 00:15:21,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Calm down.</font>

349
00:15:21,910 --> 00:15:23,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I made the call. She'll be here soon.</font>

350
00:15:23,840 --> 00:15:25,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's no rush.</font>

351
00:15:25,200 --> 00:15:26,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why aren't they here yet?</font>

352
00:15:26,790 --> 00:15:28,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They are here. Breathe in.</font>

353
00:15:33,430 --> 00:15:34,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Over here, doctor.</font>

354
00:15:37,080 --> 00:15:38,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you have the latest prenatal check-up report?</font>

355
00:15:38,910 --> 00:15:40,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We didn't bring it.</font>

356
00:15:40,670 --> 00:15:41,650
