<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We saw.</font>

409
00:21:16,020 --> 00:21:17,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Congratulations.</font>

410
00:21:17,550 --> 00:21:18,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Congratulations.</font>

411
00:21:34,920 --> 00:21:35,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

412
00:21:51,830 --> 00:21:52,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

