414
00:23:02,500 --> 00:23:11,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Mortuary Vehicles Only]</font>

415
00:23:25,160 --> 00:23:26,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Women are really great.</font>

416
00:23:28,160 --> 00:23:29,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That woman just now...</font>

417
00:23:31,400 --> 00:23:32,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She was grabbing my hand so hard.</font>

418
00:23:32,350 --> 00:23:35,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It felt like my fingers was going to break.</font>

419
00:23:36,590 --> 00:23:37,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sure it hurt really bad.</font>

420
00:23:43,160 --> 00:23:44,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You got scared,</font>

421
00:23:44,880 --> 00:23:45,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">right?</font>

422
00:23:47,920 --> 00:23:49,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianshuang is more timid than you.</font>

423
00:23:50,510 --> 00:23:51,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She was so scared that she was trembling.</font>

424
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:53,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She said the blanket was used</font>

425
00:23:54,310 --> 00:23:55,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for the deceased normally.</font>

426
00:23:56,110 --> 00:23:57,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wouldn't it be bad to use it to wrap a child?</font>

427
00:23:58,070 --> 00:23:58,570
