428
00:23:59,310 --> 00:24:00,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she was just being superstitious.</font>

429
00:24:01,400 --> 00:24:03,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if it's for the deceased, it's still made by the living.</font>

430
00:24:06,240 --> 00:24:07,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've always</font>

431
00:24:10,310 --> 00:24:11,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sent people to the afterlife.</font>

432
00:24:15,160 --> 00:24:16,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today,</font>

433
00:24:21,070 --> 00:24:23,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've welcomed someone to this world.</font>

434
00:24:47,540 --> 00:24:54,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Mortuary Vehicles Only]</font>

435
00:25:10,880 --> 00:25:12,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianshuang, someone is looking for you.</font>

436
00:25:13,110 --> 00:25:13,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who?</font>

437
00:25:14,000 --> 00:25:14,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know.</font>

438
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:25,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello.</font>

439
00:25:27,240 --> 00:25:28,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you need anything?</font>

440
00:25:29,400 --> 00:25:30,180
