441
00:25:31,070 --> 00:25:33,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Muyun asked me to pass this to you.</font>

442
00:25:34,920 --> 00:25:37,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He went back after completing the procedures with his uncle.</font>

443
00:25:38,310 --> 00:25:39,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Muyun asked me to tell you</font>

444
00:25:39,750 --> 00:25:41,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that he was very grateful for everything you had done.</font>

445
00:25:41,920 --> 00:25:42,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He has seen it.</font>

446
00:25:43,640 --> 00:25:44,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's a selfless job.</font>

447
00:25:44,750 --> 00:25:45,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

448
00:25:46,000 --> 00:25:46,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

449
00:25:46,680 --> 00:25:47,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Goodbye.</font>

450
00:25:48,070 --> 00:25:48,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Goodbye.</font>

451
