456
00:26:23,270 --> 00:26:24,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anything for me?</font>

457
00:26:24,400 --> 00:26:25,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please wait.</font>

458
00:26:33,720 --> 00:26:35,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think there are three. They are all for you.</font>

459
00:26:38,070 --> 00:26:39,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me see if there are others.</font>

460
00:26:49,350 --> 00:26:49,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's all.</font>

461
00:26:51,340 --> 00:26:52,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[10·21, From the family members of the accident victims]</font>

462
00:26:52,860 --> 00:26:53,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[From: Jiang Shengli]</font>

463
00:26:53,960 --> 00:26:55,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[From Zhu Zhanghong's Estate]</font>

464
00:27:05,110 --> 00:27:06,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chen Hexu,</font>

465
00:27:06,560 --> 00:27:09,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we've finally brought glory to the mortuary prep team!</font>

466
00:27:11,400 --> 00:27:12,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't look very happy.</font>

467
00:27:12,310 --> 00:27:13,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you happy?</font>

468
00:27:14,590 --> 00:27:15,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Happy.</font>

469
00:27:15,680 --> 00:27:16,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hold it.</font>

470
00:27:16,510 --> 00:27:17,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hold it.</font>

471
00:27:40,160 --> 00:27:41,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's enough. Don't need to show off here.</font>

472
00:27:41,680 --> 00:27:42,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just hang them where they need to be hung.</font>

473
00:27:46,110 --> 00:27:48,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've worked hard. Have some tea.</font>

474
