477
00:28:00,640 --> 00:28:02,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The mortuary prep team was sent to the police station.</font>

478
00:28:02,200 --> 00:28:03,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You still want me to send them</font>

479
00:28:03,830 --> 00:28:04,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to represent Qingliangshan</font>

480
00:28:05,000 --> 00:28:06,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the National Skills Competition?</font>

481
00:28:06,450 --> 00:28:07,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you even thinking about?</font>

482
00:28:07,720 --> 00:28:08,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have some tea first.</font>

483
00:28:08,550 --> 00:28:09,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

484
00:28:09,920 --> 00:28:11,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You didn't even participate in the demo.</font>

485
00:28:12,400 --> 00:28:13,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What will the Mortuary Care Department think of this?</font>

486
00:28:14,200 --> 00:28:15,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Many people are watching.</font>

487
00:28:15,960 --> 00:28:17,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you want me to do?</font>

488
00:28:17,480 --> 00:28:18,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Drink it while it's hot.</font>

489
00:28:18,240 --> 00:28:19,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No. I can't afford your gesture.</font>

490
00:28:24,000 --> 00:28:25,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why not?</font>

491
00:28:25,160 --> 00:28:26,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't we have fun drinking tea previously?</font>

492
00:28:27,070 --> 00:28:27,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The fresh-air system.</font>

493
00:28:28,200 --> 00:28:29,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You had tea with me, and you didn't get it done, right?</font>

494
00:28:29,960 --> 00:28:31,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Funeral expo purchase.</font>

495
00:28:31,400 --> 00:28:33,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You also had tea with me, but you didn't get it done either.</font>

496
00:28:33,400 --> 00:28:34,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is an opportunity</font>

497
00:28:34,310 --> 00:28:36,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for the kids to participate in the Skills Competition.</font>

498
00:28:36,400 --> 00:28:38,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must drink the tea and get the job done.</font>

499
00:28:38,960 --> 00:28:39,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you crazy?</font>

500
00:28:40,440 --> 00:28:41,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine. I agree to it now.</font>

501
00:28:41,880 --> 00:28:42,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How's that, Cao?</font>

502
00:28:42,920 --> 00:28:43,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll say yes.</font>

503
00:28:44,200 --> 00:28:45,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How do I convince everyone else?</font>

504
00:28:45,200 --> 00:28:45,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you thought about that?</font>

505
00:28:46,020 --> 00:28:46,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why do you need to convince others?</font>

506
00:28:46,960 --> 00:28:47,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You tell me.</font>

507
00:28:47,760 --> 00:28:48,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't the public</font>

508
00:28:48,640 --> 00:28:50,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the ones you need to convince instead?</font>

509
00:28:50,680 --> 00:28:52,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The public has sent us pennants.</font>

510
00:28:52,400 --> 00:28:53,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've been in this industry for decades, and it's rare. Right?</font>

511
00:28:54,000 --> 00:28:55,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you want every peer in the country</font>

512
00:28:55,680 --> 00:28:56,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to know them?</font>

513
00:29:05,000 --> 00:29:06,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There was no demo.</font>

514
00:29:06,640 --> 00:29:07,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why is a demo needed?</font>

515
00:29:26,030 --> 00:29:26,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director.</font>

516
00:29:28,350 --> 00:29:28,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Senior Li Yun.</font>

517
00:29:32,440 --> 00:29:34,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These kids are different from us.</font>

518
00:29:35,830 --> 00:29:37,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've spent time with them every day.</font>

519
00:29:38,680 --> 00:29:39,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They don't just see this</font>

520
00:29:39,960 --> 00:29:41,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as a job.</font>

521
00:29:42,200 --> 00:29:43,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They are really passionate.</font>

522
00:29:45,880 --> 00:29:47,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They honor the dead with care</font>

523
00:29:48,070 --> 00:29:49,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and serve the living with compassion.</font>

524
00:29:50,110 --> 00:29:51,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That is why they can create miracles</font>

525
00:29:51,400 --> 00:29:52,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">time after time.</font>

526
00:29:53,640 --> 00:29:54,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take another look at these pennants.</font>

527
00:29:56,640 --> 00:29:57,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Think about</font>

528
00:29:58,000 --> 00:29:59,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the life born</font>

529
00:29:59,160 --> 00:30:00,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in Qingliangshan a few days ago.</font>

530
00:30:07,640 --> 00:30:08,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We</font>

531
00:30:08,480 --> 00:30:09,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are unable</font>

532
00:30:09,400 --> 00:30:10,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to provide them with much material support.</font>

533
00:30:11,920 --> 00:30:13,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The fresh-air system,</font>

534
00:30:13,750 --> 00:30:15,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cloud-Managed</font>

535
00:30:15,070 --> 00:30:16,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mortuary Refrigeration Units,</font>

536
00:30:17,030 --> 00:30:18,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">hydraulic mortuary lifting trolley, and mobile trolley.</font>

537
00:30:19,000 --> 00:30:20,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can't provide them for now.</font>

538
00:30:21,350 --> 00:30:22,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can we not give them an opportunity</font>

539
00:30:23,000 --> 00:30:24,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to showcase themselves?</font>

540
00:30:26,110 --> 00:30:27,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know what you are worried about.</font>

541
00:30:27,920 --> 00:30:28,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are worried</font>

542
00:30:28,750 --> 00:30:31,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that we won't get a good result on a national stage.</font>

543
00:30:31,640 --> 00:30:33,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But is the result that important?</font>

544
00:30:34,590 --> 00:30:35,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can improve their knowledge in the industry,</font>

545
00:30:36,590 --> 00:30:38,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but their passion is what makes them great.</font>

546
00:30:39,160 --> 00:30:40,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give them a bigger stage</font>

547
00:30:40,640 --> 00:30:41,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and bigger motivation</font>

548
00:30:42,000 --> 00:30:43,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to keep their passion alive</font>

549
00:30:43,160 --> 00:30:45,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is the most important thing, Senior Li Yun.</font>

550
00:31:38,240 --> 00:31:38,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you done?</font>

551
00:31:39,590 --> 00:31:40,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This won't do.</font>

552
00:31:40,590 --> 00:31:41,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This...</font>

553
00:31:41,460 --> 00:31:43,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is too old-fashioned.</font>

554
00:31:43,440 --> 00:31:44,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It must be vibrant.</font>

555
00:31:44,400 --> 00:31:45,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are many young people nowadays.</font>

556
00:31:45,830 --> 00:31:46,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you know what era it is?</font>

557
00:31:46,750 --> 00:31:47,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

558
00:31:47,310 --> 00:31:49,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think we need to be solemn.</font>

559
00:31:49,590 --> 00:31:51,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I heard Rongcheng Funeral Home's</font>

560
00:31:51,110 --> 00:31:51,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">mortuary prep team</font>

561
00:31:51,960 --> 00:31:53,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has a film about the deceased produced</font>

562
00:31:53,070 --> 00:31:54,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">by the people from the film academy.</font>

563
00:31:54,680 --> 00:31:56,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They are going to show it during the demo session.</font>

564
00:31:57,400 --> 00:31:57,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave it to me.</font>

565
00:31:58,310 --> 00:31:58,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Although</font>

566
00:31:58,960 --> 00:32:00,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't enroll in the film academy in Beijing,</font>

567
00:32:00,400 --> 00:32:01,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I opened a bar.</font>

568
00:32:01,070 --> 00:32:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Many people from the film academy visited the place.</font>

569
00:32:02,480 --> 00:32:03,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know a few directors.</font>

570
00:32:03,720 --> 00:32:04,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll just ask them to do it.</font>

571
00:32:05,640 --> 00:32:06,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enough.</font>

572
00:32:06,590 --> 00:32:08,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's just get the slides done.</font>

573
00:32:09,510 --> 00:32:10,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Should the fonts be adjusted?</font>

574
00:32:10,920 --> 00:32:11,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look.</font>

575
00:32:11,400 --> 00:32:12,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Something's strange.</font>

576
00:32:12,570 --> 00:32:15,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you add some moving elements here?</font>

577
00:32:15,400 --> 00:32:17,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can point. But don't touch it.</font>

578
00:32:18,000 --> 00:32:19,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's enough. Is this even necessary?</font>

579
00:32:19,480 --> 00:32:20,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move.</font>

580
00:32:20,920 --> 00:32:21,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

581
00:32:21,240 --> 00:32:22,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll do it.</font>

582
00:32:22,240 --> 00:32:23,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you wiped your hands?</font>

583
00:32:23,880 --> 00:32:24,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

584
00:32:25,830 --> 00:32:26,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think we need to change this part.</font>

585
00:32:29,960 --> 00:32:31,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can who is preparing for his Fifth-Level Worker exam.</font>

586
00:32:32,440 --> 00:32:35,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are the commonly used methods to thaw a body?</font>

587
00:32:35,750 --> 00:32:37,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Natural thawing, running-water thawing, air-assisted thawing,</font>

588
00:32:37,960 --> 00:32:38,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and enclosed-chamber thawing.</font>

589
00:32:39,110 --> 00:32:41,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fourth-level Worker Song Tianshuang who is taking her Third-level exam.</font>

590
00:32:41,960 --> 00:32:43,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How to realign displaced bones?</font>

591
00:32:44,400 --> 00:32:47,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Palpate and assess. Traction and extension. Lift, pull, and apply pressure.</font>

592
00:32:47,440 --> 00:32:48,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bandage and immobilize.</font>

593
00:32:48,400 --> 00:32:49,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Third-level Worker Mao Erzhe who is taking his Second-level exam.</font>

594
00:32:50,000 --> 00:32:50,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is</font>

595
00:32:50,750 --> 00:32:52,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the operation procedure for a body in advanced decomposition?</font>

596
00:32:52,920 --> 00:32:56,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Check the records. Get rid of maggots. Reduce the swelling.</font>

597
00:32:56,310 --> 00:32:59,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fix the tissues. Bleach the skin. Remove the odor.</font>

598
00:33:00,720 --> 00:33:01,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ask me.</font>

599
00:33:01,640 --> 00:33:03,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Second-level Worker Chen Hexu who is taking her First-level exam.</font>

600
00:33:03,680 --> 00:33:04,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How does</font>

601
00:33:04,640 --> 00:33:06,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">an embalmer</font>

602
00:33:06,200 --> 00:33:08,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">guide clients through grief?</font>

603
00:33:10,160 --> 00:33:12,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Learn to listen. Practice empathy.</font>

604
00:33:12,400 --> 00:33:14,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Offer unconditional positive care.</font>

605
00:33:14,310 --> 00:33:15,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maintain professional boundaries</font>

606
00:33:16,480 --> 00:33:17,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">while giving clients hope for the future.</font>

607
00:33:19,830 --> 00:33:20,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not bad, Hexu.</font>

608
00:33:24,200 --> 00:33:25,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Team Leader. - It's rare to see everyone studying.</font>

609
00:33:27,310 --> 00:33:27,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come.</font>

610
00:33:28,480 --> 00:33:30,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have some fruits. Stay cool.</font>

611
00:33:31,070 --> 00:33:31,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you buy them for us?</font>

612
00:33:32,400 --> 00:33:33,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you think?</font>

613
00:33:33,270 --> 00:33:34,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are they from the canteen or offerings to the deceased?</font>

614
00:33:35,310 --> 00:33:37,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chef Zhao from the canteen purposely brewed this for you.</font>

615
00:33:37,200 --> 00:33:38,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Farewell Soup.</font>

616
00:33:38,310 --> 00:33:38,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See?</font>

617
00:33:39,000 --> 00:33:39,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is from the canteen.</font>

618
00:33:40,480 --> 00:33:41,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You won't even spend a single cent on us?</font>

619
00:33:42,310 --> 00:33:43,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The thought is what counts.</font>

620
00:33:45,160 --> 00:33:46,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan doesn't give gifts often.</font>

621
00:33:47,000 --> 00:33:48,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who gives mangoes?</font>

622
00:33:48,480 --> 00:33:49,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why not?</font>

623
00:33:49,680 --> 00:33:51,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These are "Concubine Mangoes". They are expensive.</font>

624
00:33:51,920 --> 00:33:53,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Receiving mangoes will "mangle" one's day.</font>

625
00:33:53,920 --> 00:33:55,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mind the superstitions.</font>

626
00:33:55,110 --> 00:33:55,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seriously.</font>

627
00:33:55,750 --> 00:33:56,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you mad?</font>

628
00:33:56,750 --> 00:33:57,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Superstitions?</font>

629
00:33:57,590 --> 00:33:59,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These kids grew up in the funeral home.</font>

630
00:33:59,400 --> 00:33:59,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

631
00:33:59,680 --> 00:34:01,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, Concubine.</font>

632
00:34:01,790 --> 00:34:03,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Apples are better, right?</font>

633
00:34:03,590 --> 00:34:05,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They represent peace and safety for us and the world.</font>

634
00:34:06,030 --> 00:34:07,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You bought too many.</font>

635
00:34:07,110 --> 00:34:08,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can't finish them.</font>

636
00:34:08,630 --> 00:34:09,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll bring some to Mr. Fang later.</font>

637
00:34:11,670 --> 00:34:13,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's no need.</font>

638
00:34:14,630 --> 00:34:15,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fang has been admitted to the hospital.</font>

639
00:34:16,110 --> 00:34:16,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He didn't want me to tell you</font>

640
00:34:16,800 --> 00:34:17,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because he didn't want to affect your studies.</font>

641
00:34:18,320 --> 00:34:18,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why?</font>

642
00:34:18,920 --> 00:34:19,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- What happened? - What's wrong with him?</font>

643
00:34:21,360 --> 00:34:22,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's nothing.</font>

644
00:34:22,550 --> 00:34:24,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll give you half a day off.</font>

645
00:34:24,190 --> 00:34:25,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All of you can visit him at the hospital.</font>

646
00:34:29,520 --> 00:34:33,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Fushan No. 1 People's Hospital]</font>

647
00:34:34,030 --> 00:34:35,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In the past,</font>

648
00:34:35,060 --> 00:34:36,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Fang always</font>

649
00:34:36,280 --> 00:34:38,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">brought out tangerines and cookies from his pocket</font>

650
00:34:38,230 --> 00:34:38,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for us.</font>

651
00:34:39,670 --> 00:34:40,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought it would always stay the same.</font>

652
00:34:41,400 --> 00:34:42,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you talking about?</font>

653
00:34:42,280 --> 00:34:43,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It'll still be the same in the future.</font>

654
00:34:50,070 --> 00:34:50,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Has Mr. Fang</font>

655
00:34:51,000 --> 00:34:52,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">been alone all the time?</font>

656
00:34:52,800 --> 00:34:55,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Team Leader Cao said he was single,</font>

657
00:34:55,230 --> 00:34:56,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and his family passed away a long time ago.</font>

658
00:34:59,480 --> 00:35:01,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if something happens to Mr. Fang</font>

659
00:35:01,480 --> 00:35:03,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">while we are out competing?</font>

660
00:35:04,000 --> 00:35:05,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu, we'll just be gone for a few days.</font>

661
00:35:06,030 --> 00:35:06,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then...</font>

662
00:35:07,480 --> 00:35:07,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I mean</font>

663
00:35:08,000 --> 00:35:09,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Fang will be alone.</font>

664
00:35:09,670 --> 00:35:10,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if something happens...</font>

665
00:35:13,670 --> 00:35:14,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When we were doing the night shift,</font>

666
00:35:15,670 --> 00:35:17,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Fang was always waiting outside the rest area</font>

667
00:35:17,630 --> 00:35:19,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because he was worried that we might be afraid.</font>

668
00:35:20,190 --> 00:35:21,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now, it's our turn to accompany him.</font>

669
00:35:25,800 --> 00:35:26,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Fang has been around</font>

670
00:35:26,880 --> 00:35:28,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">since the early days of the funeral home.</font>

671
00:35:29,440 --> 00:35:30,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Funeral workers from the previous generation</font>

672
00:35:30,880 --> 00:35:32,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has sacrificed a lot.</font>

673
00:35:34,230 --> 00:35:35,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anyway, I think</font>

674
00:35:35,230 --> 00:35:37,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Fang's situation right now is my future.</font>

675
00:35:38,000 --> 00:35:39,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone, we must stay strong later.</font>

676
00:35:41,190 --> 00:35:44,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪It's the day of the anti-Japanese war♪</font>

677
00:35:44,550 --> 00:35:47,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The Northeastern Volunteer Righteous and Brave Fighters march in front♪</font>

678
00:35:47,480 --> 00:35:50,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The people of the nation stand behind♪</font>

679
00:35:50,320 --> 00:35:52,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The Chinese Army marches forward courageously♪</font>

680
00:35:52,880 --> 00:35:54,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Aim at the enemy♪</font>

681
00:35:54,360 --> 00:35:56,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Wipe them out♪</font>

682
00:35:56,280 --> 00:35:57,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Charge!♪</font>

683
00:35:57,190 --> 00:36:01,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Swing the blade at the Japanese heads♪</font>

684
00:36:01,920 --> 00:36:03,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Kill!♪</font>

685
00:36:03,030 --> 00:36:03,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Great!</font>

686
00:36:06,190 --> 00:36:06,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Fang.</font>

687
00:36:07,300 --> 00:36:08,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Fang, we brought you</font>

688
00:36:08,560 --> 00:36:09,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- food and drinks. - Yes.</font>

689
00:36:09,700 --> 00:36:10,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All of you are being polite.</font>

690
00:36:11,630 --> 00:36:12,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These young people are...</font>

691
00:36:12,920 --> 00:36:15,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We are his grandchildren.</font>

692
00:36:17,030 --> 00:36:17,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be shocked.</font>

693
00:36:18,630 --> 00:36:20,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My colleagues at my workplace.</font>

694
00:36:20,380 --> 00:36:22,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I see.</font>

695
00:36:22,920 --> 00:36:23,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Soup brewed by my mom.</font>

696
00:36:23,840 --> 00:36:25,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll leave these at the table for now.</font>

697
00:36:25,840 --> 00:36:26,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

698
00:36:26,510 --> 00:36:27,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have quite a few friends.</font>

699
00:36:28,360 --> 00:36:30,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not friends. Comrades.</font>

700
00:36:31,360 --> 00:36:32,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We were in the same company.</font>

701
00:36:33,400 --> 00:36:36,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All of us came from the frontlines.</font>

702
00:36:37,880 --> 00:36:38,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All of them are amazing.</font>

703
00:36:38,630 --> 00:36:40,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The few of us were from the mortuary prep team back then.</font>

704
00:36:40,480 --> 00:36:42,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fang was our team leader.</font>

705
00:36:43,360 --> 00:36:47,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back then, Captain Fang led us through minefields</font>

706
00:36:47,800 --> 00:36:48,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and dodged stray cannon fire</font>

707
00:36:49,150 --> 00:36:52,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to carry back our fallen comrades one by one.</font>

708
00:36:54,150 --> 00:36:56,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In the blink of an eye, all of us have retired.</font>

709
00:36:56,920 --> 00:36:57,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

710
00:36:57,920 --> 00:37:01,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We are now the pillars of Fang's Choir Group.</font>

711
00:37:03,190 --> 00:37:05,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Old rivals at the gaming tables.</font>

712
00:37:06,590 --> 00:37:10,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We sing, dance,</font>

713
00:37:10,400 --> 00:37:11,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and fish</font>

714
00:37:11,670 --> 00:37:12,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to kill time.</font>

715
00:37:16,440 --> 00:37:17,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Decades have passed.</font>

716
00:37:18,800 --> 00:37:20,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I always believe</font>

717
00:37:21,840 --> 00:37:24,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">someone needs to send the people who have passed away off.</font>

718
00:37:24,590 --> 00:37:27,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In the past, we sent our comrades off.</font>

719
00:37:27,590 --> 00:37:28,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now, it's a peaceful era.</font>

720
00:37:29,630 --> 00:37:30,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's still the same.</font>

721
00:37:31,110 --> 00:37:32,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The law of nature.</font>

722
00:37:33,360 --> 00:37:34,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not cultured.</font>

723
00:37:35,230 --> 00:37:37,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just want to say</font>

724
00:37:37,630 --> 00:37:40,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that we must take our work seriously.</font>

725
00:37:40,670 --> 00:37:42,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enjoy and have fun after work.</font>

726
00:37:43,320 --> 00:37:45,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sing, dance, and fish.</font>

727
00:37:45,230 --> 00:37:46,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just enjoy life.</font>

728
00:37:46,880 --> 00:37:47,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

729
00:37:47,480 --> 00:37:48,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

730
00:37:48,400 --> 00:37:49,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enjoying our lives</font>

731
00:37:50,000 --> 00:37:52,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is also a way to remember our fallen comrades.</font>

732
00:37:52,630 --> 00:37:53,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

733
00:37:53,150 --> 00:37:53,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

734
00:37:54,320 --> 00:37:56,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We only live once.</font>

735
00:37:56,710 --> 00:37:58,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't live life as if you're watching a movie.</font>

736
00:37:58,800 --> 00:37:59,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you don't get it today,</font>

737
00:37:59,840 --> 00:38:01,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can rewatch it tomorrow.</font>

738
00:38:02,480 --> 00:38:03,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That won't do.</font>

739
00:38:03,360 --> 00:38:04,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That won't do.</font>

740
00:38:04,470 --> 00:38:07,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Fang, you understand life all too well.</font>

741
00:38:08,230 --> 00:38:09,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In that case,</font>

742
00:38:09,880 --> 00:38:11,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how did you end up like this?</font>

743
00:38:12,280 --> 00:38:12,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's all her fault.</font>

744
00:38:14,340 --> 00:38:14,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Me?</font>

745
00:38:16,320 --> 00:38:18,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I learned from you and kicked the robot.</font>

746
00:38:18,230 --> 00:38:20,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I ended up falling in a ditch.</font>

747
00:38:23,230 --> 00:38:24,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So is this a work injury?</font>

748
00:39:45,840 --> 00:39:46,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seriously. This is a small place,</font>

749
00:39:46,880 --> 00:39:48,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but it has amazing scenery.</font>

750
00:40:04,320 --> 00:40:04,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shuang.</font>

751
00:40:08,110 --> 00:40:09,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why is he smiling like this?</font>

752
00:40:09,510 --> 00:40:10,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He is smiling like this</font>

753
00:40:12,000 --> 00:40:13,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because he is having a sweet dream.</font>

754
00:40:13,960 --> 00:40:15,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What kind of sweet dream?</font>

755
00:40:19,900 --> 00:40:22,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Reserved]</font>

756
00:43:07,180 --> 00:43:10,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[9th Provincial Civil Affairs Industry Skills Competition]</font>

757
00:43:10,220 --> 00:43:12,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[(Embalmer Category)]</font>

758
00:43:15,110 --> 00:43:15,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bow.</font>

759
00:43:24,220 --> 00:43:25,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Qingliangshan Mortuary Prep Team Skills Competition]</font>

760
00:43:25,960 --> 00:43:29,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Judges and fellow competitors. Hello, everyone.</font>

761
00:43:30,440 --> 00:43:33,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We are the Mortuary Prep Team from Qingliangshan Funeral Home.</font>

762
00:43:34,550 --> 00:43:35,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today,</font>

763
00:43:35,880 --> 00:43:38,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the theme of our performance is</font>

764
00:43:38,920 --> 00:43:41,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"Good Night."</font>

765
00:44:01,860 --> 00:44:04,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Good Night]</font>

766
00:44:05,020 --> 00:44:07,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Playing the role of a mortuary prep team member for the first time,]</font>

767
00:44:07,240 --> 00:44:09,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[what do you think of your role in the drama?]</font>

768
00:44:09,960 --> 00:44:12,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We need someone fun.</font>

769
00:44:12,190 --> 00:44:14,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They make our lives</font>

770
00:44:15,640 --> 00:44:16,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">more interesting.</font>

771
00:44:17,230 --> 00:44:18,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can is like a slab</font>

772
00:44:19,440 --> 00:44:21,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that is thrown</font>

773
00:44:21,280 --> 00:44:22,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">into the Duyue River.</font>

774
00:44:22,850 --> 00:44:25,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It creates ripples on the surface.</font>

775
00:44:25,700 --> 00:44:26,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks to the big splash,</font>

776
00:44:26,970 --> 00:44:29,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the fish and shrimp in the river will also move around.</font>

777
00:44:30,130 --> 00:44:31,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In my opinion, Chen Hexu</font>

778
00:44:31,920 --> 00:44:36,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">makes me feel like I am being hugged.</font>

779
00:44:36,070 --> 00:44:38,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I interact with this character,</font>

780
00:44:38,230 --> 00:44:39,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel safe.</font>

781
00:44:39,190 --> 00:44:40,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can be at ease.</font>

782
00:44:40,840 --> 00:44:42,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can do whatever I want.</font>

783
00:44:42,070 --> 00:44:43,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's how I am.</font>

784
00:44:43,670 --> 00:44:44,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Personally,</font>

785
00:44:44,840 --> 00:44:45,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't behave like that</font>

786
00:44:45,920 --> 00:44:46,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">most of the time.</font>

787
00:44:47,320 --> 00:44:49,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao Erzhe is someone who goes with the flow.</font>

788
00:44:49,800 --> 00:44:53,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">However, during that process,</font>

789
00:44:53,230 --> 00:44:57,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think it's also a good thing to try</font>

790
00:44:57,800 --> 00:44:59,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and go against the flow</font>

791
00:44:59,360 --> 00:45:01,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or to jump out of the water.</font>

792
00:45:02,030 --> 00:45:03,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm very happy</font>

793
00:45:03,880 --> 00:45:06,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to have spent two months with the role of Song Tianshuang.</font>

794
00:45:07,510 --> 00:45:09,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think providing warmth</font>

795
00:45:10,590 --> 00:45:12,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to many people from Song Tianshuang's perspective</font>

796
00:45:13,150 --> 00:45:14,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">gives me a great sense of achievement.</font>

797
00:45:14,800 --> 00:45:17,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's as if I've handled many deceased people</font>

798
00:45:18,920 --> 00:45:20,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as a member of the mortuary prep team.</font>

799
00:45:22,340 --> 00:45:23,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[After understanding and experiencing it deeply,]</font>

800
00:45:23,720 --> 00:45:25,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[how do you see the funeral industry]</font>

801
00:45:25,420 --> 00:45:27,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[and the mortuary prep team?]</font>

802
00:45:27,440 --> 00:45:28,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The nature of this job</font>

803
00:45:28,290 --> 00:45:29,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">means they are less likely</font>

804
00:45:29,510 --> 00:45:31,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to communicate or chat</font>

805
00:45:31,320 --> 00:45:32,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with the outside world.</font>

806
00:45:32,320 --> 00:45:32,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hope</font>

807
00:45:32,750 --> 00:45:34,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that people don't find it scary</font>

808
00:45:34,860 --> 00:45:35,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when they think about this.</font>

809
00:45:35,960 --> 00:45:37,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need to give it such a high value.</font>

810
00:45:37,480 --> 00:45:38,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Think of it as something ordinary.</font>

811
00:45:38,710 --> 00:45:39,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just a job.</font>

812
00:45:42,440 --> 00:45:43,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They feel like family.</font>

813
00:45:43,960 --> 00:45:45,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someone else brought the deceased</font>

814
00:45:45,190 --> 00:45:46,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">into this world.</font>

815
00:45:46,630 --> 00:45:49,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We are the ones who send the deceased off.</font>

816
00:45:49,320 --> 00:45:50,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All of you have worked hard.</font>

817
00:45:51,800 --> 00:45:53,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not just in terms of physical work</font>

818
00:45:53,670 --> 00:45:56,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but the opinion of society</font>

819
00:45:56,880 --> 00:45:59,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about the funeral home workers.</font>

820
00:46:00,550 --> 00:46:01,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All of you have it rough,</font>

821
00:46:01,510 --> 00:46:02,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">physically and mentally.</font>

822
00:46:03,150 --> 00:46:04,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan told me</font>

823
00:46:04,070 --> 00:46:05,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she still had nightmares until today.</font>

824
00:46:06,590 --> 00:46:07,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you imagine the feeling</font>

825
00:46:08,110 --> 00:46:09,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of someone who has worked hard</font>

826
00:46:09,190 --> 00:46:10,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in this industry for about 20 years</font>

827
00:46:10,840 --> 00:46:12,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and still have nightmares</font>

828
00:46:12,510 --> 00:46:14,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">after seeing a dead body?</font>

829
00:46:14,440 --> 00:46:15,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hope we can</font>

830
00:46:16,920 --> 00:46:18,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">recognize the people working in this industry.</font>

831
00:46:18,960 --> 00:46:22,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Understand and care for them more.</font>

832
00:46:23,000 --> 00:46:24,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mortuary workers are the ones working</font>

833
00:46:24,960 --> 00:46:25,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in between life and death.</font>

834
00:46:26,150 --> 00:46:27,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Or in a black and white world,</font>

835
00:46:27,190 --> 00:46:28,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they are playing a gray role.</font>

836
00:46:28,550 --> 00:46:29,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm worried.</font>

837
00:46:30,030 --> 00:46:31,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I love these people.</font>

838
00:46:31,480 --> 00:46:34,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hope my energy</font>

839
00:46:34,760 --> 00:46:36,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and my enthusiasm</font>

840
00:46:36,760 --> 00:46:38,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can show everyone</font>

841
00:46:38,590 --> 00:46:40,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that these people are actually quite interesting.</font>

842
00:46:40,550 --> 00:46:41,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When we only know...</font>

843
00:46:41,510 --> 00:46:43,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We only know how to live</font>

844
00:46:43,190 --> 00:46:45,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">once we know how we die.</font>

845
00:46:46,220 --> 00:46:48,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">["Good Night" has come to an end.]</font>

846
00:46:48,440 --> 00:46:51,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Is there anything you want to tell yourself in the drama?]</font>

847
00:46:51,400 --> 00:46:52,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think Wang Can</font>

848
00:46:55,190 --> 00:46:56,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has it rough.</font>

849
00:46:57,920 --> 00:47:00,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You (Wang Can) created all the troubles.</font>

850
00:47:00,230 --> 00:47:01,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you have the ability to create it,</font>

851
00:47:01,710 --> 00:47:03,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you have the ability to deal with it.</font>

852
00:47:03,630 --> 00:47:05,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think you've done a good job.</font>

853
00:47:06,480 --> 00:47:07,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">(Mao Erzhe,) time to date someone.</font>

854
00:47:08,550 --> 00:47:10,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think Mao Erzhe should date someone.</font>

855
00:47:10,400 --> 00:47:11,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just keep living like this.</font>

856
00:47:11,360 --> 00:47:12,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I like you (Cao Yongji) so much.</font>

857
00:47:14,400 --> 00:47:15,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be afraid to show vulnerability.</font>

858
00:47:15,840 --> 00:47:17,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone will take good care of you (Song Tianshuang).</font>

859
00:47:20,320 --> 00:47:21,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">(Su Dandan,) you've worked hard.</font>

860
00:47:22,880 --> 00:47:24,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chen Hexu,</font>

861
00:47:27,070 --> 00:47:28,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">love yourself.</font>

862
00:47:29,110 --> 00:47:30,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You need to believe</font>

863
00:47:31,480 --> 00:47:32,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that all of us love you.</font>

864
00:47:34,740 --> 00:47:37,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Thanks to the viewers]</font>

865
00:47:37,580 --> 00:47:41,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[for spending these wonderful moments with us]</font>
